eme of panda  tears  i feel bad for the cursed corpses more  so than i do for yaga but it doesn't  really matter so long as the tragedy  does its job  and it does just that good job akitami  you've ruined me  once again and that pretty much does it  for chapter 147 of jujutsu kaisen and  screw this chapter but what do you guys  think please leave your thoughts in the  comments below or even join my discord  server and if you're keen for some more  jujutsu sorcery then please do check out  some of my other videos or even  subscribe to the channel for very maybe  regular jujutsu kaiser morbidity  delivered straight into your youtube  feed but for now this has been the new  world review  and i'll see you next time

